  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can grapple and pin your foes with astonishing speed.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Rapid Grappler<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> If you use Greater Grapple to successfully maintain a grapple as a move action, you can make a grapple combat maneuver as a free action. If you spend one use of your mythic power when making this grapple check, you may roll twice and use the better result. You can use this feat only once per round.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Using Rapid Grappler is a swift action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc43\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
